WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.705 --> 00:00:18.575
The next morning Ally met Kate at Everything Mart.

2
00:00:21.196 --> 00:00:22.657
"Let me do the talking, Ally.

3
00:00:23.878 --> 00:00:27.741
I have a way with salespeople," Kate said, leading the way through the store.

4
00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:32.444
"I'll get them to give you a new phone since the one you bought isn't working well."

5
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.721
"That's okay," Ally said.

6
00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:39.963
"I've actually decided to return the new phone and buy a desktop computer instead."

7
00:00:39.983 --> 00:00:45.965
"What?" Kate stopped at the electronics counter and stared at her in shock.

8
00:00:46.966 --> 00:00:50.627
"You have to have a phone!

9
00:00:51.327 --> 00:00:53.688
How will you text with Julius or call me?"

10
00:00:55.329 --> 00:00:57.130
Just then a salesman came over.

11
00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:58.750
"May I help you?"

12
00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:00.711
"Yes, please."

13
00:01:01.291 --> 00:01:02.332
Kate smiled sweetly.

14
00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:06.341
"My friend bought this phone a week ago, and it's not working properly.

15
00:01:07.022 --> 00:01:07.782
Show him, Ally."

16
00:01:10.443 --> 00:01:11.944
Ally gripped Alpha tightly.

17
00:01:11.964 --> 00:01:14.605
"Uh, I don't think it's that bad."

18
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:16.745
"Yes, it is."

19
00:01:17.546 --> 00:01:19.647
Kate grabbed the device out of Ally's hands.

20
00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:21.127
"Unhand me!"

21
00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:22.288
Alpha squawked.

22
00:01:23.368 --> 00:01:24.629
Ally laughed nervously.

23
00:01:24.649 --> 00:01:30.511
"Hmm." The salesman scratched his chin.

24
00:01:30.531 --> 00:01:32.652
"Have you downloaded many apps?"

25
00:01:33.788 --> 00:01:37.909
"Oh, she's got lots of strange apps on this phone," Kate said.

26
00:01:37.929 --> 00:01:41.830
"Hmm. Unauthorized apps can cause big problems.

27
00:01:42.471 --> 00:01:43.331
I'll reset the phone."

28
00:01:44.111 --> 00:01:47.392
The salesman took the device from Kate and started to open the back.

29
00:01:47.412 --> 00:01:50.413
"No!" Ally grabbed the phone.

30
00:01:50.433 --> 00:01:53.754
"Uh, I mean, I can do that myself.

31
00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:55.934
Thanks! I'm going to keep this phone.

32
00:01:56.675 --> 00:01:59.435
But can you please show me your most powerful computer?"

33
00:01:59.455 --> 00:02:05.301
"Sure." The salesman shrugged and pointed to a computer on a shelf behind the counter.

34
00:02:05.321 --> 00:02:08.762
"This is the fastest computer you can buy as a consumer."

35
00:02:10.503 --> 00:02:11.283
"How much is it?"

36
00:02:11.663 --> 00:02:12.223
Ally asked.

37
00:02:12.243 --> 00:02:16.284
"The cost is 1,862 dollars, including tax."

38
00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:18.225
Ally gulped.

39
00:02:18.245 --> 00:02:22.226
"That's practically all the money I have," she thought.

40
00:02:22.246 --> 00:02:25.427
"I guess it's worth it to get Alpha working again."

41
00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.788
Ally took her wallet out and started to count bills.

42
00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.021
But it was a slow process.

43
00:02:34.382 --> 00:02:37.325
Her superfast counting skills weren't working anymore either!

44
00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:46.572
for helping me carry this big box home, Kate," Ally said.

45
00:02:46.592 --> 00:02:49.334
"No problem," Kate said.

46
00:02:49.354 --> 00:02:54.178
"It's not very heavy, but it would definitely be awkward to carry it by yourself."

47
00:02:55.880 --> 00:03:00.383
The girls were near the UFO Museum when they saw Phil and a woman in a security guard

48
00:03:00.463 --> 00:03:03.200
uniform. Phil waved.

49
00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.021
"What have you got there?"

50
00:03:05.041 --> 00:03:10.162
"Ally bought a new computer with her prize money," Kate said.

51
00:03:11.102 --> 00:03:11.683
Ally nodded.

52
00:03:11.703 --> 00:03:13.683
"It's superpowerful."

53
00:03:13.703 --> 00:03:15.724
"Oh my gosh!"

54
00:03:16.064 --> 00:03:18.044
The woman squealed as she stared at them.

55
00:03:18.745 --> 00:03:21.385
"You two were on Food Truck Rally!"

56
00:03:21.405 --> 00:03:26.527
"Yes, we were," Kate said proudly.

57
00:03:26.547 --> 00:03:28.227
"Did you see the show?"

58
00:03:28.247 --> 00:03:30.428
"Did she see it?"

59
00:03:32.168 --> 00:03:32.769
Phil laughed.

60
00:03:32.789 --> 00:03:36.770
"It's all she's been talking about since I started training her at work.

61
00:03:39.451 --> 00:03:40.971
Kate, Ally, this is Tina.

62
00:03:41.631 --> 00:03:42.872
She's new in Sandville."

63
00:03:44.032 --> 00:03:45.592
Ally and Kate smiled at Tina.

64
00:03:45.612 --> 00:03:48.573
"It's nice to meet you," Tina said.

65
00:03:48.593 --> 00:03:53.455
"I was already excited to move to Sandville and start working at the museum.

66
00:03:54.275 --> 00:03:58.356
But meeting the winners of a TV show makes it even more exciting!"

67
00:03:59.412 --> 00:04:01.373
"Welcome to town," Ally said.

68
00:04:01.393 --> 00:04:03.674
"It's a very nice place to live.

69
00:04:04.794 --> 00:04:06.595
I was a stranger here too once."

70
00:04:07.776 --> 00:04:08.416
"Were you?"

71
00:04:08.936 --> 00:04:10.136
Tina lifted her eyebrows.

72
00:04:10.156 --> 00:04:12.237
"Where did you move from?"

73
00:04:13.438 --> 00:04:17.059
Ally didn't know what to say, but luckily Phil was glancing at his watch.

74
00:04:17.079 --> 00:04:20.061
"We have a meeting with the boss, Tina," he said.

75
00:04:20.081 --> 00:04:22.342
"See you later, girls!"

76
00:04:25.623 --> 00:04:28.144
When the girls reached Ray's house, Kate stopped.

77
00:04:30.784 --> 00:04:33.326
"Want me to come in and help you set up the computer?"

78
00:04:33.346 --> 00:04:37.688
"You've done more than enough, Kate," Ally said.

79
00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:39.549
"Thanks! I'll see you later."

80
00:04:39.929 --> 00:04:44.972
Before Kate could insist, Ally carried the box into the house and closed the door behind her.

81
00:04:44.992 --> 00:04:49.635
"I hope I didn't hurt Kate's feelings," Ally thought, heading to her room.

82
00:04:49.655 --> 00:04:54.217
"But I can't let her see me move Alpha from the phone into the computer!"

83
00:04:56.118 --> 00:04:58.640
Soon Ally had the new computer all set up.

84
00:05:00.284 --> 00:05:02.765
Ally held her breath as she pressed the power button.

85
00:05:02.785 --> 00:05:06.547
"This is the moment of truth!"

86
00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:09.628
Nothing happened.

87
00:05:11.209 --> 00:05:11.909
"Oh no!"

88
00:05:13.229 --> 00:05:13.910
Ally gasped.

89
00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:18.071
"Maybe that salesman did wipe all of Alpha's data!"

90
00:05:18.692 --> 00:05:21.013
But then two eyes blinked onto the screen.

91
00:05:21.033 --> 00:05:25.134
"Alpha!" Ally exclaimed.

92
00:05:25.154 --> 00:05:27.415
"Thank goodness you're back!

93
00:05:27.796 --> 00:05:28.556
Are you all right?"

94
00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:33.403
"Affirmative." "It's been awful, Alpha.

95
00:05:33.904 --> 00:05:38.308
I lost my powers, and you weren't working, and—" "Halt," Alpha ordered.

96
00:05:38.328 --> 00:05:39.949
"Memory overload.

97
00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:45.854
Motherboard requires a full recalibration and reboot before any inputs can be processed."

98
00:05:46.775 --> 00:05:48.136
"How long will that take?"

99
00:05:48.516 --> 00:05:49.077
Ally asked.

100
00:05:49.957 --> 00:05:50.638
Alpha buzzed.

101
00:05:51.519 --> 00:05:53.761
"Approximately one to two Earth days."

102
00:05:54.581 --> 00:05:55.622
"Two days!"

103
00:05:56.283 --> 00:05:58.072
Ally's shoulders sagged.

104
00:05:58.092 --> 00:06:00.717
"I can't stand being without my powers much longer.

105
00:06:01.398 --> 00:06:03.743
Make it one day if you can, please!"
